From: Christopher Owen <christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:51:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] models: DeepSeek-V4.1 model architecture, Engram, vision
 encoder, and model registry

Upstream base: 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
Rationale: Update the DeepSeek-V4.1 model implementation for TileLang-only execution, disk/in-memory Engram tables, sequence-parallel prefill, vision tower, and model registry wiring.
Quality impact: none (tree-identical squash of qualified candidate-77 vLLM tree 58f9b11080cf8ebeccd80c0ce1d9bb7a6ff4ae58).
Tests: candidate-77 release-tests (12,082 passed, 0 failed) and 2-boot tp3-triangle screen.
Upstream status: local squashed subsystem patch (tree-identical to candidate-77 0001..0871).
